      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was also bit surprised about ranking. When i read the text why it's poor ranked, this is also because CPU use on some dynamic bones. A avatars with many dynamic bones is more CPU use than avatar with sturdy design (so less wiggle effects).\n\nThere is warning on Colliders use, because it will double CPU use. Many colliders oke... but that sum it only more and more.\nNot all VRChat users have powerful CPUs. I hope you keep it in mind about many dynamic bones use. That is also why \"it wont perform well on some system\" message is said.\n\nYou're fine if you have powerful game pc, but don't forgot you're not alone in VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
