      "value": "@{5bcbaf75fab2337b72ced6b0|full_name}: I totally understand that, but I think that having a few dynamic bones won't cause too much of a problem... if someone has 20 or 40 dynamic bones... then that's bad. But 2 or 4 small (with small bone chains) do not influence performance that much. Also... if somebody runs a PC with a low performance CPU I think soon people will be able to toggle dynamic bones ingame.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/toggle-dynamic-bones-option-1",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
