      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Excellent\" is intended to be the very top-end of performance-- an avatar you'd expect to wear when you want to absolutely minimize the impact you have on the performance of users around you. It is a \"Gold Star\" you can stick on your fridge-- you don't have to get to this rank, but kudos if you do. \"Good\" is good enough 95% of the time.\n\nDynamic Bone is heavy enough that even in small amounts, it multiplies the performance cost for the avatar by double or more.\n\nAny number of DB or DBC in \"Excellent\" would break the intent of the rank.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
