  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-22T15:23:53.899Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I noticed many people are upset about the avatar performance ranking: https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/avatar-ranking-system-and-its-problems\n-\nI was just about to add dynamic bones to my own avatar. And I immeadiatly fell into \"poor\". In the pics you can see, that what I have is not that much... but because my hands can collide with my tits (two bones) and my ears (2 bone chains, 6 bones) i get the worst rating.\nThats why I would suggest loosening the policy up a bit.\n-\n---------------very good----------------\n- 4 Dynamic bone components\n- 16 Dynamic Bone Transforms\n\n------------------good------------------\n- 8 dynamic bone components\n- 32 dynamic bone transforms\n- 2 dynamic bone colliders\n- 16 dynamic bone collision count\n-----------------medium-----------------\n- 16 dynamic bone components\n- 64 dynamic bone transforms\n- 4 dynamic bone colliders\n- 32 dynamic bone collision count\n-------------------poor-------------------\nA \"poor\" avatar is fine as it is. There is no need for changes.",
